{"version":1,"content":"<p>Mercury Research數據顯示，AMD在2026年第三季度的桌面處理器出貨份額降至29.9%，較第二季度的34.9%下滑5個百分點；Intel則回升至70.1%。這是AMD數月來首次出現季度份額下跌，也是其自2025年初以來的最低水平。一年前，AMD桌面CPU出貨份額為33.6%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586346.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.986423+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:36:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"f0ef105a688533df00499a3523f028d5d8644e23550c84f521cf1be5d8c7a5d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}